{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约拿书","commonName":"约拿书","title":"约拿书","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"029ca4d2eb1b1c2cc0e47bf2fbd452a8a1c4e1a147cd781bd41c94fced3e200a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这事令约拿十分不悦，非常恼怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他向耶和华祷告说：“耶和华啊，我在家乡的时候岂不早就说过你会这样做吗？我知道你是一位有恩典、好怜悯的上帝，不轻易发怒，充满慈爱，不忍心降灾，所以我才急速逃往他施。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华啊，求你收回我的性命吧，我死了比活着还好！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华对他说：“你这样大发脾气合理吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["约拿出城，在城东为自己搭了一个棚，坐在棚下荫凉处，要看看尼尼微城究竟会怎样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华上帝安排了一棵蓖麻迅速地长起来，为约拿遮荫，使他的头免受日晒。约拿因有这棵蓖麻而非常欢喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第二天黎明的时候，上帝却安排了一条虫来咬这棵蓖麻，蓖麻就枯萎了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["太阳出来的时候，上帝刮起燥热的东风，烈日把约拿晒得发昏，他就再次求死说：“我死了比活着还好！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["上帝对约拿说：“你为这棵蓖麻大发脾气合理吗？”约拿回答说：“我就是气死了也合理。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华说：“这棵蓖麻不是你种的，也不是你栽培的，它在一夜之间长成，又在一夜之间死去，你尚且如此爱惜，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我怎能不爱惜这尼尼微大城呢？城中单是连左右手都分不清的人就有十二万多，还有许多的牲畜。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}